<title>ISRAEL: Teva Q2 EPS $0.55 vs $0.01 Q2 96.</title>
<headline>Teva Q2 EPS $0.55 vs $0.01 Q2 96.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teva Pharamaceutical Industries Ltd.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of dollars except EPS)</p>
<p>			   Q2 97    Q2 96	6-MTH 97    6-MTH 96</p>
<p>Revenue		  270,668  219,437    538,246     439,522</p>
<p>Operating Profit	46,798    4,005     92,331	32,029</p>
<p>Net Profit		33,956	605     65,427	19,293</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share	0.55     0.01	 1.06	  0.32</p>
<p>Note: 1996 figures include one-time after tax expense of $14.9 million or $0.24 per share for acquisition of Biocraft Laboratories Inc in May 1996.</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
